    "content" : "This formula, reported as equation (79) in [12], holds for ℜ(\uD835\uDC58) > 0. By setting the parameters to match our exponential distribution, \uD835\uDC58 = 1, \uD835\uDEFC = \uD835\uDF0E(11−\uD835\uDF0C) , \uD835\uDC4F ="
